## Gov/Govt Domains
# will match domains that end with ".gov" or ".govt" and optionally those that have a two to five-letter TLD after ".gov" or ".govt" (e.g., ".gov.uk", ".gov.au")
/.*\.gov(|t)(\.[a-z]{2,5})?$/

## Mail Domains
# will match domains ending with the keyword in the domain matching for a trailing 1-3 digits (restricted to 2-3 letter TLD)
/.*mail(|s)\-?[\d]{0,3}(\.(co|org|gov|govt|ac|net|com))?\.[\w]{2,3}$/
# will match domains with a leading 1-3 character word or digit or literally anything so long as it also has a "." or "-" at the beginning of the keyword and/or will match for literally anything following the keyword (restricted to 2+ letter TLD)
/(.*(\.|\-))*[\w\d]{0,3}mail.*\.[\w]{2,}$/

## Links, Redirectors and Tracking Domains
# will match domains ending with the keyword in the domain matching for a trailing 1-3 digits (restricted to 2-3 letter TLD)
/.*(link(|s)|redirect(|s|or)|track(|er|ing))\-?[\d]{0,3}(\.(co|org|gov|govt|ac|net|com))?\.[\w]{2,3}$/
# will match domains with a leading/trailing 1-3 digit or literally anything so long as it also has a "." or "-" at the beginning or end of the keyword (restricted to 2+ letter TLD)
/(.*(\.|\-))*[\d]{0,3}(link(|s)|redirect(|s|or)|track(|er|ing))[\d]{0,3}((\.|\-).*)*\.[\w]{2,}$/

## Image Domains
# will match domains ending with the keyword in the domain matching for a trailing 1-3 digits (restricted to 2-3 letter TLD)
/.*(image(|s)|img(|s))\-?[\d]{0,3}(\.(co|org|gov|govt|ac|net|com))?\.[\w]{2,3}$/
# will match domains with a leading/trailing 1-3 digit or literally anything so long as it also has a "." or "-" at the beginning or end of the keyword (restricted to 2+ letter TLD)
/(.*(\.|\-))*[\d]{0,3}(image(|s)|img(|s))[\d]{0,3}((\.|\-).*)*\.[\w]{2,}$/

## Other Common Supportive Domains
# will match domains ending with the keyword in the domain (restricted to 2-3 letter TLD)
/.*(blog(|s)|forum(|s)|communit(y|ies)|board(|s)|portal(|s)|platform(|s)|service(|s)|resource(|s)|network(|s)|director(y|ies)|guide(|s)|wiki|help|support|doc(|s)|news|update(|s)|knowledgebase(|s))\-?[\d]{0,3}(\.(co|org|gov|govt|ac|net|com))?\.[\w]{2,3}$/
# will match domains with a leading/trailing 1-3 digit or literally anything so long as it also has a "." or "-" at the beginning or end of the keyword (restricted to 2+ letter TLD)
/(.*(\.|\-))*[\d]{0,3}(blog(|s)|forum(|s)|communit(y|ies)|board(|s)|portal(|s)|platform(|s)|service(|s)|resource(|s)|network(|s)|director(y|ies)|guide(|s)|wiki(|s)|help|support|doc(|s)|news|update(|s)|knowledgebase(|s))[\d]{0,3}((\.|\-).*)*\.[\w]{2,}$/

